      "filename": "Footbridge across the lower Afon Cwm Edno - geograph.org.uk - 203085.jpg",
      "title": "File:Footbridge across the lower Afon Cwm Edno - geograph.org.uk - 203085.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/Footbridge_across_the_lower_Afon_Cwm_Edno_-_geograph.org.uk_-_203085.jpg",
